---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us | RetainOS"
  description="We built RetainOS to give dental practices a real operating system — one that replaces six separate tools with a single branded patient app."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: 'https://retaindental.com/' },
    { name: 'About', url: 'https://retaindental.com/about' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="pt-36 pb-24 px-6 bg-paper-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-sans font-[400] text-text-900 tracking-tight mb-6">Built for the <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-violet-600 to-violet-400">modern dental practice</span>.</h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-text-600 leading-relaxed">We started RetainOS because we saw smart clinics losing patients to no-shows, siloed software, and broken recall workflows. The solution wasn't another add-on — it was a unified platform.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-20">
        <div class="p-8 rounded bg-white border border-paper-line">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-violet-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-3">Our Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-text-600 leading-relaxed">Eliminate patient leakage from dental practices. We believe every clinic deserves enterprise-grade retention tools without the enterprise price tag or integration headache.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 rounded bg-white border border-paper-line">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-violet-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-3">The Team</h2>
          <p class="text-text-600 leading-relaxed">A lean team of engineers, product designers, and dental operations veterans who have built patient engagement systems for DSOs across the United States.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 rounded bg-white border border-paper-line">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-violet-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"/><path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-3">Bootstrapped & Profitable</h2>
          <p class="text-text-600 leading-relaxed">We're not funded by venture capital. Every feature we build is driven by real clinic feedback, not investor milestones. This keeps our pricing sane and our roadmap honest.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-8 rounded bg-white border border-paper-line">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded bg-violet-600/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6366F1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-900 mb-3">Since 2024</h2>
          <p class="text-text-600 leading-relaxed">Our first pilot clinic went live in late 2024. Today we're serving 12 pilot clinics and expanding to 50 by Q3 2026. Every deployment is white-label and live in under 20 minutes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="https://app.retaindental.com" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-violet-600 text-white rounded font-bold text-lg hover:bg-violet-500 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-violet-600/20">Build Your App <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
